          <h4 class="font-extrabold text-slate-700 font-sans text-sm mb-1">Python SM-2 Algorithm Implementation:</h4>
          <pre class="bg-slate-900 text-sky-400 p-3 rounded-xl overflow-x-auto">
def calc_sm2(q: int, reps: int, interval: int, ease: float):
    if q < 3:
        return 0, 1, ease
    else:
        if reps == 0:
            new_interval = 1
        elif reps == 1:
            new_interval = 6
        else:
            new_interval = round(interval * ease)
        new_ease = max(1.3, ease + (0.1 - (5 - q) * (0.08 + (5 - q) * 0.02)))
        return reps + 1, new_interval, new_ease</pre>
